OL,3,ALucy Letby inquiry to publish findings
OL,4,Ainto how nurse was able to murder seven
OL,5,Ababies
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry has also looked at whether
OL,8,Faction could have been taken sooner to
OL,9,Fstop Letby. It has not examined her
OL,10,Fguilt
OL,12,FLady Justice Thirlwall, who led the
OL,13,Finquiry, will make a statement in
OL,14,FLiverpool when the report is published
OL,15,F- you'll be able to watch her live at
OL,16,Fthe top of this page
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
